# Smooth loft (roadmap 20): with the top circle's sketch active, a line
# of the middle square and the bottom circle picked, New Group > Loft To
# Selected Profile joins the three by one smooth surface, from the top
# down; the group screen lists the profiles in order and the turn.
# Analyze > Check Solid finds it sound; [-1] turns the profiles after the
# first by one curve, still sound; undo turns them back, to the first
# volume.
file $testdata/ui/loft_sections.tlspr
menu File|Open...
view default
move 292.5 232.5
down L 292.5 232.5
up L 292.5 232.5
move 292.5 217.5
down L 292.5 217.5
up L 292.5 217.5
menu New Group|Loft To Selected Profile
dump
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
twmove 334 185
twdown L 334 185
twup L 334 185
tw
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
key z ctrl
answer ok
menu Analyze|Check Solid
